  "description": "Construction of a single storey rear extension",
  "development_type": "Other house holder developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">The proposed development, by reason of scale, siting, design, bulk, mass and appearance would be an undesirable addition, representing an overly dominant and disproportionate extension to the dwelling.&nbsp; The rear extension would be a significant addition to the rear of the terrace dwelling, impacting the character and symmetry, and failing to appear as subordinate.&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;As such, the proposed development is contrary to:<br></div><div><br></div><div><p><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \" pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">-\r\nNational Planning Policy Framework </span>National Planning Policy Framework\r\n(NPPF) (MHCLG, 2024)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \" pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">- Policy D4 of the\r\nLondon Plan (March 2021)</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \" pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">- The Residential\r\nExtensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \" pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">-\r\nPolicies SP2, DMD1 and DMD5 of </span>The London Borough of Barking and\r\nDagenham’s Draft Local Plan: (September 2024)<o:p></o:p></p></div>",
    "<div>The scale, siting and design of the proposed development would result in an increased sense of overbearingness and overshadowing&nbsp; to neighbouring occupiers, therefore constituting unneighbourly development and contrary to:<br></div><div><br></div><div><p><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \" pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">-\r\nNational Planning Policy Framework </span>National Planning Policy Framework\r\n(NPPF) (MHCLG, 2024)<o:p></o:p></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \" pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">- Policy\r\nD4 of the London Plan (March 2021);</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \" pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">- The Residential\r\nExtensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012);<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \" pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">-\r\nPolicies SP2, DMD1 and DMD5 of </span>The London Borough of Barking and\r\nDagenham 2037: (September 2024)<o:p></o:p></p></div>"
